<title>MOZAMBIQUE: SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE HELD AT HOME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE HELD AT HOME.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Cosafa Castle Cup</p>
<p>match at the Machava stadium in Maputo on Sunday:</p>
<p>Mozambique 1 Namibia 1 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mozambique - Pinto Barros (19th minute)</p>
<p>Namibia - Silvester Goraseb (44th)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under matches played, won, drew, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>Mozambique  3  1  2  0  6  3  5</p>
<p>    Namibia     3  1  2  0  5  2  5</p>
<p>    Zambia	2  1  1  0  6  2  4</p>
<p>    Tanzania    3  0  2  1  2  5  2</p>
<p>    Malawi	3  0  1  2  3  10 1</p>
<p>Next match:</p>
<p>Zambia v Mozambique, Lusaka, August 2.</p>
